  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PWR SECT RESTRUCTRIN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT AIMS TO ASSIST GOSL TO IMPLEMENT A NEW POWER SECTOR INDUSTRY STRUCTURE, WITH COMMERCIAL COMPANIES FOR GENERATION TRANSMISSION AND DISTRIBUTION OPERATING UNDER AN INDEPENDENT REGULATORY FRAMEWORK.  THE PROJECT WILL ENABLE THE GOVERNMENT TO (I) ESTABLISH AND OPERATE THE REGULATORY COMMISSION; (II) UNDERTAKE MUCH-NEEDED INVESTMENTS IN TRANSMISSION, DISTRIBUTION AND RURAL ELECTRIFICATION; AND (III) PROVIDE TECHNICAL ASSISTANCE TO THE NEW COMPANIES AND SECTOR ENTITIES.</narrative>
  </description>
